<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus, the name to sinners dear,</l><l>The name to sinners giv’n;</l><l>It scatters all their guilty fear,</l><l>It brings them peace of heav’n.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Jesus the prisoner’s fetters breaks,</l><l>And bruises Satan’s head;</l><l>Pow’r into strengthless souls He speaks,</l><l>And life into the dead.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Oh, that the world might taste and see,</l><l>The riches of His grace!</l><l>The arms of love that compass me,</l><l>Would all mankind embrace.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Him as my righteousness I show,</l><l>His saving truth proclaim:</l><l>’Tis all my business here below,</l><l>To cry, Behold the Lamb!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Happy, if with my latest breath</l><l>I may but gasp His name:</l><l>Preach Him to all, and cry in death,</l><l>“Behold, behold the Lamb!”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
